        "node_id": "n_2_e8cfe3",
        "thought_text": "Use logarithmic comparison to avoid computing huge numbers like n! or 2^n directly, converting the inequality g(n) <= m into log(g(n)) <= log(m) to handle the large input constraints safely.",
